// The latest compiled Applivery SOAR Agent binary per (platform, arch)
// variant — pushed here directly by each agent repo's own GitHub Actions CI
// (see agentBuilds.service.ts's module doc) on every push to main. `arch` is
// "amd64" or "arm64" for windows (the agent repo's CI builds both, via WiX);
// macos is single-arch and always "universal". One row per (platform, arch),
// upserted in place (mirrors DevicePushData's own "payload always holds the
// latest" convention) — this is a rolling "latest build" store, not a
// version history. Global (no workspaceSlug): the binary itself is identical
// for every workspace, same reasoning as the GitHub-token-based
// agentDownloads.service.ts config being global. `data` holds the raw
// binary (~5-10MB) directly in Postgres — small enough that a dedicated
// object-storage layer isn't worth the added infrastructure.
model AgentBuild {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
